Z||000000||Blade||09-14-2000||03:25 PM||||Well finaly someone wanted to race me in my fiero. Everyone seems to not be interested. Rice boys ect...at stop lights the look away and never rev there engines or anything. <P>Well on my way to work i was just cruizing from light to light. Came up next to a 2000 camero. I left the light a lil quick but wasnt trying to be fast and he left it kinda slow. so the next light im sitting there, getting ready to go. Just gonna cruize since the camero didnt even rev his engine. Light changes and i hear him chip his tires. So i floored it. He got a half a carlenth before i new we were gonna race. I got back the car lenth and then we were neck and neck till we had to both slow down at next light. He was just starting to pull away at the very end(like mabe gained 6 inches on me). <BR>He turned real quick at the next light. I was laughing my ass off at how well my 600 dollar car did.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Blade||||reg||1
